{
  "lang": "en",
  "film": "Malcolm X",
  "source_rel": "Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 4/Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 4.mp4",
  "t_start_global": 3443.05,
  "t_end_global": 3564.69,
  "duration": 121.64,
  "clip": "Malcolm X.mp4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.78,
      "text": "I must emphasize at the outstart",
      "filename": "segment001.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 1.78,
      "end": 4.12,
      "text": "that the Honorable Elijah Muhammad is not a politician.",
      "filename": "segment002.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 5.22,
      "end": 8.08,
      "text": "So I'm not here this afternoon as a Republican,",
      "filename": "segment003.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 8.78,
      "end": 9.68,
      "text": "nor as a Democrat.",
      "filename": "segment004.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 11.72,
      "end": 14.46,
      "text": "Not as a Mason, nor as an Elf.",
      "filename": "segment005.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 15.96,
      "end": 18.22,
      "text": "Not as a Protestant, nor a Catholic.",
      "filename": "segment006.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 18.86,
      "end": 21.1,
      "text": "Not as a Christian, nor a Jew.",
      "filename": "segment007.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 21.52,
      "end": 23.62,
      "text": "Not as a Baptist, nor a Methodist.",
      "filename": "segment008.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 23.96,
      "end": 26.12,
      "text": "In fact, not even as an American.",
      "filename": "segment009.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 27.34,
      "end": 28.76,
      "text": "Because if I was an American,",
      "filename": "segment010.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 29.74,
      "end": 31.8,
      "text": "the problem that confronts our people today",
      "filename": "segment011.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 31.8,
      "end": 32.64,
      "text": "wouldn't even exist.",
      "filename": "segment012.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 36.58,
      "end": 38.44,
      "text": "So I have to stand here today",
      "filename": "segment013.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 38.44,
      "end": 41.54,
      "text": "as what I was when I was born, a black man.",
      "filename": "segment014.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 46.66,
      "end": 49.84,
      "text": "Before there was any such thing as a Republican or a Democrat,",
      "filename": "segment015.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 50.5,
      "end": 51.08,
      "text": "we were black.",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 51.42,
      "end": 53.96,
      "text": "Before there was any such thing as a Mason or an Elf,",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 54.34,
      "end": 55.06,
      "text": "we were black.",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 55.38,
      "end": 58.2,
      "text": "Before there was any such thing as a Jew or a Christian,",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 58.68,
      "end": 59.5,
      "text": "we were black people.",
      "filename": "segment020.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 60.2,
      "end": 62.64,
      "text": "In fact, before there was any such place as America,",
      "filename": "segment021.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 63.12,
      "end": 63.98,
      "text": "we were black.",
      "filename": "segment022.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 64.74,
      "end": 68.02,
      "text": "And after America has long passed from the scene,",
      "filename": "segment023.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 68.6,
      "end": 70.14,
      "text": "there will still be black people.",
      "filename": "segment024.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 75.4,
      "end": 80.64,
      "text": "Every election year, these politicians are sent up here to pacify us, they're sent here",
      "filename": "segment025.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 80.64,
      "end": 82.68,
      "text": "and set up here by the white man.",
      "filename": "segment026.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 83.34,
      "end": 84.28,
      "text": "This is what they do.",
      "filename": "segment027.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 84.92,
      "end": 87.28,
      "text": "They send drugs in Harlem down here to pacify us.",
      "filename": "segment028.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 88.02,
      "end": 90.42,
      "text": "They send alcohol down here to pacify us.",
      "filename": "segment029.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 90.64,
      "end": 93.68,
      "text": "They send prostitution down here to pacify us.",
      "filename": "segment030.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 94.12,
      "end": 97.12,
      "text": "Why you can't even get drugs in Harlem without the white man's permission.",
      "filename": "segment031.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 97.44,
      "end": 100.58,
      "text": "You can't get prostitution in Harlem without the white man's permission.",
      "filename": "segment032.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 100.58,
      "end": 103.92,
      "text": "You can't get gambling in Harlem without the white man's permission.",
      "filename": "segment033.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 104.46,
      "end": 109.22,
      "text": "Every time you break the seal on that liquor bottle, that's a government seal you're breaking.",
      "filename": "segment034.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 110.36,
      "end": 113.54,
      "text": "Oh, I say it, I say it again, you've been had.",
      "filename": "segment035.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 114.36,
      "end": 115.4,
      "text": "You've been took.",
      "filename": "segment036.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 116.2,
      "end": 117.74,
      "text": "You've been hoodwinked.",
      "filename": "segment037.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 118.58,
      "end": 119.06,
      "text": "Bamboozled.",
      "filename": "segment038.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 119.62,
      "end": 120.38,
      "text": "Led astray.",
      "filename": "segment039.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 120.94,
      "end": 121.64,
      "text": "Run amok.",
      "filename": "segment040.mp4"
    }
  ]
}